# Commandment

Evaluation contract for this HIP kernel. All five sections below are
mandatory and enforced by kernel_languages/contract.py::validate_commandment.

## Setup

```bash
export PYTHONPATH="{{ repo_root }}:${PYTHONPATH:-}"
export GEAK_WORK_DIR="{{ repo_root }}"
{% if compile_command -%}
# Build step — {{ compile_command | length }} char build command:
{{ compile_command }}
{%- endif %}
```

